Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Elisabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm working all the time without getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I finally get to bed, I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It really wears me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use someone to ask me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a bit late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then let's meet down at The Mask in fifteen minutes.
